I have an export file with 4 fields in each record i.e.

AAAAAAA  ; BBBBBBBBB ; C            ; DDD
AAAA         ; BBBBBB          ; CCCCCC    ;   D

and I need to reformat the records by removing the ";"  with the
following condition

1. A field starts from 1st col. to 7th col.
2. B field starts from 8th col. to 34th col.
3. C field starts from 35th col. to 55th col.
