Hello,

Yes the Digital equivalent is : tcpdump

First in your kernel file, you need to add:
options     PACKETFILTER

Rebuild your kernel and after rebooting do this:


cd /dev
MAKEDEV pfilt

pfconfig -a +promisc +copyall -b 255

and run tcpdump
example:

tcpdump -x -v -s 1500 broadcast

Hope this will help you !!!

