cc: Warning: probe.c, line 7: In the initializer for y[0], "("Hi there")" has a
larger data size than "signed char".  Assignment may result in data loss.
char y[]=("Hi there");
---------^
cc: Warning: probe.c, line 7: In the initializer for y[0], "("Hi there")" of typ
e "pointer to signed char", is being converted to "signed char".
char y[]=("Hi there");
---------^
cc: Error: probe.c, line 7: In the static initialization, the address cannot be
converted to the destination type.
char y[]=("Hi there");
---------^
alpha1 mutt-0.95.6 168: cc -std1 probe.c
cc: Error: probe.c, line 7: In the initializer for y a required set of braces is
 missing.
char y[]=("Hi there");
---------^

